{
  "Name": "Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes - Okta Network Zone Modified, Deactivated or Deleted",
  "Description": "Alert: Alert - Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes\nMITRE ATT&CK: Defense Evasion / T1562\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Network Zone Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\" or \"<ip>|Okta Network Zone Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\"\n\nDetects changes to Okta network zones: zone.update, zone.deactivate, zone.delete, zone.remove_blacklist and network_zone.rule.disabled. Network zones back sign-on policies and IP blocking; an attacker may weaken or remove them to evade those controls. Merges the separate modify, deactivate and delete rules.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/cloud/okta/okta_network_zone_deactivated_or_deleted/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/okta/okta_network_zone_deactivated_or_deleted.yml",
  "GUID": "6955a652-265d-51ad-85fe-8974212b6cb6",
